# and license details.
#
# openi2pd: i2pd.links.
#
# The router's compiled-in certificate directory is /var/lib/i2pd/certificates.
# CMake installs the packaged certificates read-only under /usr/share/i2pd, so
# keep only this compatibility link. Configuration and tunnels are passed
# explicitly from /etc/i2pd by the systemd and SysV service definitions.
#

usr/share/i2pd/certificates var/lib/i2pd/certificates
